  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2110_announce_01",
      "hash64": "1F70B67B077993A5",
      "text": "Kommen wir zum ersten Kampf!\\nWen wird das Los zusammenführen...?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2110_announce_02",
      "hash64": "1F70B37B07798E8C",
      "text": "Champ [VAR 0x0100(0000)] gegen...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2110_announce_03",
      "hash64": "1F70B47B0779903F",
      "text": "...Pepper aus der Klasse 2-G!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_01",
      "hash64": "FF7D962F20C08000",
      "text": "Das ist nicht euer Ernst! Gleich in Runde 1 soll ich\\ngegen einen Champ ran?![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_02",
      "hash64": "FF7D992F20C08519",
      "text": "Du bist sicher überrascht, dass ich auch\\nmitmache, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_03a",
      "hash64": "E2EC9F14A71EA4E5",
      "text": "Hehe... Allein dein verdutztes Gesicht zu sehen,\\nwar mir die ganze Mühe wert![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_03b",
      "hash64": "E2EC9C14A71E9FCC",
      "text": "Was? Du hattest damit gerechnet, dass ich hier\\nteilnehmen würde?\\c\\nIch bin echt ein offenes Buch für dich, wie?\\nKein Wunder, dass wir beste Freunde sind![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_04",
      "hash64": "FF7D9B2F20C0887F",
      "text": "In Zone Null ist mir bewusst geworden, dass ich\\nmich noch deutlich steigern muss...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_05",
      "hash64": "FF7D9A2F20C086CC",
      "text": "Also hab ich mit Mastifioso und meinem Team\\nein extrem hartes Training absolviert![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_06",
      "hash64": "FF7D9D2F20C08BE5",
      "text": "Denn falls es jemals wieder brenzlig wird,\\nmöchte ich Seite an Seite und auf Augenhöhe\\r\\nmit dir kämpfen können.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_07",
      "hash64": "FF7D9C2F20C08A32",
      "text": "Aus diesem Grund will ich heute auch gewinnen!\\nMir egal, ob durch Glück oder Können![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_08",
      "hash64": "FF7D9F2F20C08F4B",
      "text": "Vor dir steht der neue Pepper, und der pfeffert\\ndir jetzt erst mal ein paar neue Schärfegrade in\\r\\ndein Küchenregal! Wohl bekomms![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2110_announce_04",
      "hash64": "1F70B17B07798B26",
      "text": "Und [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0C0A,0000)]der Siegerdie Siegerin des ersten Kampfes ist...\\nChamp [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0C0A",
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2110_mobs_01",
      "hash64": "2D42C46ACEC44DC1",
      "text": "Hurra! So macht man das!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2110_mobs_02",
      "hash64": "2D42C16ACEC448A8",
      "text": "Was für ein fantastischer Kampf, und das schon\\ngleich in Runde 1!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_09",
      "hash64": "FF7D9E2F20C08D98",
      "text": "Wow, als Champ kämpfst du echt in ’ner anderen\\nLiga!\\c\\nDie Niederlage zieht mich zwar runter, aber...\\nEs war mir eine Ehre![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_10",
      "hash64": "FF7A312F20BD9E8A",
      "text": "Es könnte wohl nicht schaden, wenn ich die\\nArenen ebenfalls mal abklappern würde...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_2110_friend_11",
      "hash64": "FF7A322F20BDA03D",
      "text": "Leg dich im nächsten Kampf bitte besonders\\nins Zeug. Auch für mich, verstanden?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
